# Planning documents, kept by the maintainer and not published. The code cites
# the specification by "§" and prior-art.md by name; both are in git history
# up to the commit that made them local, and the maintainer has the current
# text. security-model.md and system.md stay public: users read the first to
# decide whether to trust SESKit with an access key, and a test holds the
# stylesheet to the second.
